WEBVTT

00:01:29.079 --> 00:01:32.413
that in people with Alzheimer's

00:01:32.454 --> 00:01:37.621
and in laboratory mice
that model the disease,

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:41.288
gamma waves at the frequency of 40 hertz

00:01:41.288 --> 00:01:46.079
have reduced power and synchrony
than they should be.

00:01:46.746 --> 00:01:49.788
So back in 2015,

00:01:49.788 --> 00:01:51.371
we got an idea.

00:01:51.788 --> 00:01:56.038
What if we artificially
boosted these waves?

00:01:56.996 --> 00:01:59.496
Would that affect Alzheimer's disease?